    "_about": [
      "Rungs of the two Qwen ladders that sit at roughly the same size, one generation apart.",
      "They are not a clean contrast on their own: the two ladders run on different GPUs, engines and number formats, so a difference between them mixes the training generation with the serving stack.",
      "What separates the two: serve one Qwen 3 model at sm80-vllm0280 as well, by adding a second serve file to its `deployments`. The same weights under two stacks measure the stack, which is what the harness cell needs anyway."
    ],
    "pairs": [
      {"qwen3": "qwen3-0.6b", "qwen3.5": "qwen3.5-0.8b", "matched_on": "0.6B against 0.8B"},
